    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The season's gentle call has prompted people seeking connection on the other side to brave the journey. Despite a surge in border crossings and the boundary enforcers' response, the enforcement policy outcome has kept crossings remain at historic lows. This outcome, however, is shadowed by a legislative stalemate: government officials are deadlocked legislators, locked in a funding dispute that prevents cohesive action, highlighting a growing rupture in the boundary's fabric of national unity.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Lover",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-0",
          "result-0",
          "result-1"
        ],
